{"default":{"entry":{"id":"exchange-031","title":"斯特灵大学夏季研学","kind":"notice","category":"exchange","category_label":"国际交流","summary":"斯特灵大学夏季研学，包含语言培训、文化参访与实地考察。","tags":["国际交流","官方公告"],"editorial_note":"","featured":true,"spotlight":false,"material_ids":[],"versions":[{"notice_id":"notice-9f0437d1a4154c766590f0d7","year":2026,"published":"2026-03-06","deadline":"2026-04-30T15:59:59+00:00","deadline_kind":"notice","stage_start":"2026-08-01","stage_end":null,"colleges":["unknown"],"levels":["international"],"college_role":"原文相关单位，不代表报名限制","level_basis":"依据公告标题中的范围词；选拔阶段单独保留。","audience":"","audience_scope":{"kind":"unknown","colleges":[],"evidence":""},"source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm","conflict":false,"edition_label":"","original_title":"","registration_windows":[],"fact_count":null,"content_profile":{"sections":[],"coverage":{"audience":false,"conditions":false,"location":false,"registration":false,"materials":false,"schedule":false,"content":false,"benefits":false,"duties":false,"other":true},"truncated":true},"participation_facts":[]}],"collegeSelections":[]},"notice":{"notice_id":"notice-9f0437d1a4154c766590f0d7","year":2026,"published":"2026-03-06","deadline":"2026-04-30T15:59:59+00:00","deadline_kind":"notice","stage_start":"2026-08-01","stage_end":null,"colleges":["unknown"],"levels":["international"],"college_role":"原文相关单位，不代表报名限制","level_basis":"依据公告标题中的范围词；选拔阶段单独保留。","audience":"","audience_scope":{"kind":"unknown","colleges":[],"evidence":""},"source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm","conflict":false,"edition_label":"","original_title":"","registration_windows":[],"fact_count":0,"content_profile":{"schema_version":"activity-profile-1","processed_on":"2026-10-17","status":"partial","sections":[{"kind":"other","title":"参与信息","items":[{"text":"2026年斯特灵大学夏季研学已开放报名，行程安排参考下图：","locator":"正文第1段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"原文如下：","locator":"正文第3段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"1、 研学 时间","locator":"正文第8段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"2026年8月1日--2026年8月15日","locator":"正文第9段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"2、 报名方式","locator":"正文第10段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"3、 研学费用","locator":"正文第19段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"2960英镑，涵盖住宿、活动、教学、培训、游览及英国签证费用（不含往返机票、境外保险）。","locator":"正文第20段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"4、 支持服务","locator":"正文第21段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"斯特灵大学教职工及合作方将提供支持，包括机场接送、日常关怀、教学及工作坊指导等服务。","locator":"正文第22段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"5、 活动安排","locator":"正文第23段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"两周期间每日均有完整活动计划，包括实地考察、英语语言培训及徒步旅行。","locator":"正文第24段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"6、 住宿","locator":"正文第25段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"斯特灵大学提供设施完善的住宿，含舒适的卧室及社交公共区域，邻近校园且交通便捷，便于探索城市，为你的停留提供理想环境。","locator":"正文第26段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"7、 签证","locator":"正文第27段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"斯特灵大学教职工及本地合作方将协助签证申请。","locator":"正文第28段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"8、 校园","locator":"正文第29段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"斯特灵大学校园被誉为苏格兰最美校园之一，坐落于群山、湖泊、野生动物与绿地构成的壮丽景致中，不仅是拥有世界级设施、餐饮场所、商店等的活力学习环境，更是放松身心、体验“微缩苏格兰”的胜地 ，更是拥有世界级设施、餐饮场所、商店等的活力学习环境。","locator":"正文第30段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"9、 城市探访","locator":"正文第31段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"斯特灵位于苏格兰中心地带，是一座历史悠久的美丽城市，以宏伟的城堡闻名，距苏格兰两大城市爱丁堡和格拉斯哥仅短途车程。你还将探访美丽的中世纪城市约克（曾为英格兰首都）、建筑闻名的著名大学城剑桥，以及英国首都伦敦。在伦敦可游览大英博物馆、议会大厦、白金汉宫等热门景点，体验全球顶级购物乐趣。","locator":"正文第32段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"},{"text":"（ 以上信息来源于英国斯特灵大学，详情请见附件 ）","locator":"正文第33段","source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm"}]}],"attachments":[],"pending":["联系人小节已隐去","参与对象本批未提取到","条件限制本批未提取到","地点本批未提取到","报名步骤本批未提取到","材料本批未提取到","日程本批未提取到","活动内容本批未提取到","费用与奖励本批未提取到","岗位职责本批未提取到"],"coverage":{"audience":false,"conditions":false,"location":false,"registration":false,"materials":false,"schedule":false,"content":false,"benefits":false,"duties":false,"other":true}},"participation_facts":[]},"groups":[],"activity_id":"exchange-031"},"notices":{"notice-9f0437d1a4154c766590f0d7":{"entry":{"id":"exchange-031","title":"斯特灵大学夏季研学","kind":"notice","category":"exchange","category_label":"国际交流","summary":"斯特灵大学夏季研学，包含语言培训、文化参访与实地考察。","tags":["国际交流","官方公告"],"editorial_note":"","featured":true,"spotlight":false,"material_ids":[],"versions":[{"notice_id":"notice-9f0437d1a4154c766590f0d7","year":2026,"published":"2026-03-06","deadline":"2026-04-30T15:59:59+00:00","deadline_kind":"notice","stage_start":"2026-08-01","stage_end":null,"colleges":["unknown"],"levels":["international"],"college_role":"原文相关单位，不代表报名限制","level_basis":"依据公告标题中的范围词；选拔阶段单独保留。","audience":"","audience_scope":{"kind":"unknown","colleges":[],"evidence":""},"source_url":"https://oice.cdu.edu.cn/info/1050/3835.htm","conflict":false,"edition_label":"","original_title":"","registration_windows":[],"fact_count":null,"content_profile":{"sections":[],"coverage":{"audience":false,"conditions":false,"location":false,"registration":false,"materials":false,"schedule":false,"content":false,"benefits":false,"duties":false,"other":true},"truncated":true},"participation_facts":[]}],"collegeSelections":[]},"notice":{"notice_id":"notice-9f0437d1a4154c766590f0d7","year":2026,"published":"2026-03-06","deadline":"2026-04-30T15:59:59+00:00","deadline_kind":"notice","stage_start":"2026-08-01","stage_end":null,"colleges":["unknown"],"levels":["international"],"college_role":"原